# Rookery Stacks' egg-collectors' hollow (CIPlay rookery_stacks_caves, 11-11; any world). Points as in its recipe (the
# origin frame): the mouth at -10 55.5 on hill 3's low north foot; level south 10 m (to -10 45.5) under the spur north
# of the summit, 2 mushrooms inside. Dry, no air zone, no chest; the spikes stay.
island Rookery Stacks keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm

picture rk_cave_out -10 5 64 -10 4 55.5
walk -10 61 to -10 55.5 to -10 51 to -10 47
picture rk_cave_in -10 6.2 54 -10 5.2 46 light=20
wait 2
walk -10 47 to -10 51 to -10 55.5 to -10 61
